HW1_LOG_ONLY:[FXP_mul/Area/Synthesis]                 set to [boundary [dict get $mapping to]]
HW1_LOG_ONLY:[FXP_mul/Area/Synthesis]                 if {![sizeof_collection $from] || ![sizeof_collection $to]} {
