HW1_LOG_ONLY:[FXP_adder/Area/Synthesis]     [dict create from {s2_*_reg*/Q*} to {s3_*_reg*/D}] \
HW1_LOG_ONLY:[FXP_adder/Area/Synthesis]     [dict create from {s3_*_reg*/Q*} to {s4_*_reg*/D}] \
