HW1_LOG_ONLY:[FXP_adder/Between/Synthesis]     puts $coverage
HW1_LOG_ONLY:[FXP_adder/Between/Synthesis]     if {[regexp -nocase {(Warning:|Error:)[^\n]*(unconstrained|not constrained|no clock|no input delay|no output delay)} $coverage]} {
