HW1_LOG_ONLY:[FLP_adder_4/Between/Synthesis]     close $fd
HW1_LOG_ONLY:[FLP_adder_4/Between/Synthesis]     puts $coverage
HW1_LOG_ONLY:[FLP_adder_4/Between/Synthesis]     if {[regexp -nocase {(Warning:|Error:)[^\n]*(unconstrained|not constrained|no clock|no input delay|no output delay)} $coverage]} {
